  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies detailed failure reasons for MMS download requests handled by a carrier messaging service.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>These values represent the Android <c>DOWNLOAD_STATUS_MMS_ERROR_</c> constants. Each maps to the corresponding <c>SmsManager.MMS_ERROR_</c> result, but the numeric values are different. These failures do not request a retry through the carrier network. In particular, <see cref="F:Android.Service.Carrier.DownloadStatusMmsErrorType.Retry" /> reports a retry error; it is not <see cref="F:Android.Service.Carrier.MessageDownloadStatus.RetryOnCarrierNetwork" />.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/refs/tags/android-16.0.0_r1/core/java/android/service/carrier/CarrierMessagingService.java">Android 16 carrier messaging download result definitions.</a></format></para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
